                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Iddings to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1901-08-01"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">August 1, 1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Iddings inquires if he shall give testimony against a pickpocket, which is
                    desired by an Italian court.)</p>
            </div>
